on exitFrame
  [  0] pushsymb 111 ............................ <#stop>
  [  3] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [  6] pusharglistnoret 2 ...................... <2>
  [  8] extcall 49 .............................. sound stop 2
  [ 11] pushint8 9 .............................. <9>
  [ 14] pusharglist 1 ........................... <9>
  [ 16] extcall 103 ............................. <sprite(9)>
  [ 19] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 20] setobjprop 104 .......................... sprite(9).visible = 0
  [ 23] ret
end
